  "notes": "Material UI (MUI) based Next.js site for Bulgarian donation platform. Signature: sky-blue (#32a9fe/#4ac3ff) brand with a warm yellow (#ffd54f) 'Дарете сега' CTA and yellow-outlined secondary buttons; blue bird logo reused as placeholder image for beneficiary/organizer. Sticky right sidebar with white 16px-radius shadowed card persists through the whole page. Heart icons mark each donation. Sub-section 'Пожелания' shows donor wishes as quotes. Pill chips under the title are in-page anchor links. Transparency is a core theme: financial reports with info tooltips, empty expense grid, trust points with yellow line illustrations. Placeholder gallery images (sunset landscape) are seed data. Scroll-to-top floating circular button appears bottom-right after scroll."
